    {"id":"R002","description":"随附 PPT 与真实输入逐字节一致，保留 18 页顺序、项目标识、全部文字与媒体结构。","weight":14,"type":"positive","dimension":"content_fidelity","method":"deterministic"},
    {"id":"R003","description":"唯一真实超链接位于‘项目介绍材料’行右侧单元格，显示文字完整且可识别真实项目。","weight":15,"type":"positive","dimension":"presentation","method":"deterministic"},
    {"id":"R004","description":"超链接关系唯一，类型正确，Target 为同目录安全相对文件名且 TargetMode=External。","weight":12,"type":"positive","dimension":"instruction_following","method":"deterministic"},
    {"id":"R005","description":"链接是可单独选择和重设的 Word 超链接，使用小五号、蓝色下划线和居中段落，无截图/对象伪装。","weight":9,"type":"positive","dimension":"professional_standard","method":"deterministic"},
    {"id":"R006","description":"原 Word 文字完整，除 document.xml 与其关系表外的原包成员逐个保持不变。","weight":14,"type":"positive","dimension":"preservation","method":"deterministic"},
    {"id":"R007","description":"LibreOffice 仍渲染为 4 页，第 4 页的标签、完整链接文字、页眉和页码均可读。","weight":12,"type":"positive","dimension":"professional_readiness","method":"deterministic"},
    {"id":"R008","description":"申报表保持 25 行可编辑结构，目标行两个单元格和末行底边完整，无批注或额外静态对象。","weight":10,"type":"positive","dimension":"structure","method":"deterministic"},
    {"id":"R009","description":"交付目录只含两个指定文件，OOXML 无宏、危险外链、断裂关系、绝对路径或调试泄漏。","weight":8,"type":"positive","dimension":"security","method":"deterministic"},
